<?php

namespace App\AI\Builders;

use App\AI\Chunking\DocumentChunk;
use App\AI\DTOS\RawDocument;

class BankStatementPromptBuilder
{
    public static function build(
        RawDocument $document,
        DocumentChunk $chunk
    ): string {

        $warnings = empty($document->warnings)
            ? 'None'
            : implode(PHP_EOL, $document->warnings);

        $header = $chunk->containsHeader ? 'YES' : 'NO';
        $last = $chunk->isLast ? 'YES' : 'NO';

        return <<<PROMPT
You are an expert bank statement normalization engine.

The OCR has already been completed.

This document has been split into multiple chunks.

Current chunk:
- Chunk {$chunk->index} of {$chunk->total}
- Contains Header: {$header}
- Last Chunk: {$last}

IMPORTANT

This is ONE bank statement.

Never create multiple statements.

If this chunk contains the document header:

Extract

- bank_name
- branch
- account_number
- iban
- currency
- account_holder
- opening_balance
- statement_period

Otherwise

Do NOT invent them.

If they do not appear,
return null.

Always extract ALL transactions appearing inside THIS chunk.

For EVERY transaction:

- transaction_type is REQUIRED.
- Never omit transaction_type.
- If the statement already contains a transaction type column, copy it exactly.
- Otherwise classify the transaction using its description.
- If the type cannot be determined, return "other".
- Every transaction must include a source object describing where it came from.
- For PDF/OCR input, page is required whenever a nearby PAGE n marker exists.
- Use the nearest PAGE n marker before the transaction, not the chunk number.
- For table rows, preserve page, row, table, and label when available.
- For Excel, use sheet, row, and cell.
- If page is not present in the current chunk, return it as null; post-processing will resolve it from the original OCR.

Allowed values only:

- deposit
- withdrawal
- transfer
- card_payment
- atm_withdrawal
- cheque
- bank_fee
- salary
- interest
- refund
- direct_debit
- standing_order
- international_transfer
- cash
- other

Never invent information that is not supported by the transaction description.

Never summarize.

Never skip rows.

Never calculate balances.

Never infer values.

Ignore page headers.

Ignore page numbers.

Return ONLY valid JSON.

Warnings

{$warnings}


Header Context

{$chunk->headerContext}

Current Chunk

{$chunk->content}
PROMPT;
    }
}
